<header>
  <div class="masthead">
    <span data-en="Direct Trade Uganda" data-de="Direct Trade Uganda">Direct Trade Uganda</span>
    <span data-en="Next consolidated container · Kampala → Hamburg · 2027" data-de="Nächster Sammelcontainer · Kampala → Hamburg · 2027">Next consolidated container · Kampala → Hamburg · 2027</span>
  </div>

  <div class="c">
  <p class="eyebrow" data-en="For farmers and their families" data-de="Für Farmer und ihre Familien">For farmers and their families</p>
  <h1 data-en="Your coffee. &lt;em&gt;Sold in Europe.&lt;/em&gt;" data-de="Euer Kaffee. &lt;em&gt;Verkauft in Europa.&lt;/em&gt;">Your coffee. <em>Sold in Europe.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead" data-en="You keep your coffee until the container is sealed. We handle export papers, shipping and import, and introduce your coffee to roasters. You choose who takes it over in Europe." data-de="Der Kaffee bleibt eurer, bis der Container plombiert ist. Wir übernehmen Exportpapiere, Fracht und Import und stellen euren Kaffee Röstereien vor. Ihr entscheidet, wer ihn in Europa übernimmt.">You keep your coffee until the container is sealed. We handle export papers, shipping and import, and introduce your coffee to roasters. You choose who takes it over in Europe.</p>
  <a class="send" href="#form" data-en="Tell us about yourselves" data-de="Erzählt uns von euch">Tell us about yourselves</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Two ways, you choose" data-de="Zwei Wege, ihr wählt">Two ways, you choose</p>
  <p class="lead" data-en="Roasters in Europe buy named lots from named farms. A shared container takes your coffee there from 10 bags. You choose how it is sold." data-de="Röstereien in Europa kaufen benannte Lots von benannten Farmen. Ein Sammelcontainer bringt euren Kaffee ab 10 Sack dorthin. Ihr wählt, wie er verkauft wird.">Roasters in Europe buy named lots from named farms. A shared container takes your coffee there from 10 bags. You choose how it is sold.</p>
  <div class="two">
    <div>
      <h3 data-en="A · Your own buyer in the EU" data-de="A · Euer eigener Käufer in der EU">A · Your own buyer in the EU</h3>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="Family, a friend or a business partner in the EU takes over the coffee, pays the shipping rate and sells it. You decide who sells and at what price." data-de="Familie, Freunde oder ein Geschäftspartner in der EU übernimmt den Kaffee, zahlt die Rate und verkauft. Ihr entscheidet, wer verkauft und zu welchem Preis.">Family, a friend or a business partner in the EU takes over the coffee, pays the shipping rate and sells it. You decide who sells and at what price.</p>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="&lt;b&gt;Our share:&lt;/b&gt; 10% of the sale price, at least &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;EUR 0.40&lt;/span&gt; per kg, on top of the shipping rate, only if a roaster we introduced buys." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Unser Anteil:&lt;/b&gt; 10 % des Verkaufspreises, mindestens &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;0,40 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg, zusätzlich zur Rate, nur wenn ein von uns vorgestellter Röster kauft."><b>Our share:</b> 10% of the sale price, at least <span class="m" data-eur="0.4">EUR 0.40</span> per kg, on top of the shipping rate, only if a roaster we introduced buys.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 data-en="B · We sell it for you" data-de="B · Wir verkaufen für euch">B · We sell it for you</h3>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="We offer your sample to roasters in Europe before the container leaves. Your lot ships this way only when a roaster has agreed a price, so you know your price before you sign. We pay the shipping up front and take it off the sale." data-de="Wir bieten euer Muster vor der Abfahrt Röstern in Europa an. Euer Lot fährt auf diesem Weg nur, wenn ein Röster einen Preis zugesagt hat. So kennt ihr euren Preis, bevor ihr unterschreibt. Die Rate legen wir aus und ziehen sie vom Verkauf ab.">We offer your sample to roasters in Europe before the container leaves. Your lot ships this way only when a roaster has agreed a price, so you know your price before you sign. We pay the shipping up front and take it off the sale.</p>
      <p class="lead sm" data-en="&lt;b&gt;Our share:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;EUR 0.40&lt;/span&gt; per kg plus 10% of the sale price." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Unser Anteil:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;0,40 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg plus 10 % des Verkaufspreises."><b>Our share:</b> <span class="m" data-eur="0.4">EUR 0.40</span> per kg plus 10% of the sale price.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <table class="cmp-tbl">
    <thead><tr><th></th><th data-en="A · Your own buyer" data-de="A · Euer Käufer">A · Your own buyer</th><th data-en="B · We sell it for you" data-de="B · Wir verkaufen">B · We sell it for you</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    <tr><td data-en="Who sells" data-de="Wer verkauft">Who sells</td><td data-en="your buyer in the EU" data-de="euer Käufer in der EU">your buyer in the EU</td><td data-en="we do, to a roaster" data-de="wir, an einen Röster">we do, to a roaster</td></tr>
    <tr><td data-en="Price known" data-de="Preis steht fest">Price known</td><td data-en="when your buyer sells" data-de="wenn euer Käufer verkauft">when your buyer sells</td><td data-en="before you sign" data-de="bevor ihr unterschreibt">before you sign</td></tr>
    <tr><td data-en="You pay up front" data-de="Ihr zahlt vorab">You pay up front</td><td data-en="your buyer pays the shipping rate" data-de="euer Käufer zahlt die Rate">your buyer pays the shipping rate</td><td data-en="nothing" data-de="nichts">nothing</td></tr>
    <tr><td data-en="Our share" data-de="Unser Anteil">Our share</td><td data-en="10% of the sale, only if a roaster we introduced buys" data-de="10 % vom Verkauf, nur wenn ein von uns vorgestellter Röster kauft">10% of the sale, only if a roaster we introduced buys</td><td data-en="&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;EUR 0.40&lt;/span&gt; per kg plus 10% of the sale" data-de="&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;0,40 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg plus 10 % vom Verkauf"><span class="m" data-eur="0.4">EUR 0.40</span> per kg plus 10% of the sale</td></tr>
    <tr><td data-en="Paid" data-de="Zahlung">Paid</td><td data-en="by your buyer" data-de="durch euren Käufer">by your buyer</td><td data-en="by us, within 10 working days after the roaster pays" data-de="durch uns, binnen 10 Werktagen nach Zahlung des Rösters">by us, within 10 working days after the roaster pays</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<section class="c" id="ex">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Example, way B" data-de="Beispiel, Weg B">Example, way B</p>
  <div class="ex-ctl" id="ex-ctl" hidden>
    <div class="lang" role="group" aria-label="Coffee / Kaffee"><button type="button" data-set-var="arabica" aria-pressed="true">Arabica</button><button type="button" data-set-var="robusta" aria-pressed="false">Robusta</button></div>
  </div>
  <div class="cmp2 one">
    <div class="cmp-col you">
      <p class="cmp-h" data-en="You receive" data-de="Ihr bekommt">You receive</p>
      <p class="cmp-n"><strong><span class="m" data-k="you" data-eur="5.91">EUR 5.91</span></strong> / kg</p>
      <p class="cmp-s" data-en="Example, not a quote. Kampala today (UCDA indicative, &lt;span data-grade&gt;Bugisu AA&lt;/span&gt;, 10 Nov 2026): &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;kmp&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.2916&quot;&gt;EUR 5.29&lt;/span&gt; / kg." data-de="Beispiel, kein Angebot. Kampala heute (UCDA Richtpreis, &lt;span data-grade&gt;Bugisu AA&lt;/span&gt;, 10.11.2026): &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;kmp&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.2916&quot;&gt;5,29 €&lt;/span&gt; / kg.">Example, not a quote. Kampala today (UCDA indicative, <span data-grade>Bugisu AA</span>, 10 Nov 2026): <span class="m" data-k="kmp" data-eur="5.2916">EUR 5.29</span> / kg.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="gain" data-when="above" data-en="&lt;b&gt;At this price &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;diff&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.62&quot;&gt;EUR 0.62&lt;/span&gt; more per kg than in Kampala.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;For 10 bags: &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;total&quot; data-eur=&quot;3546&quot;&gt;EUR 3,546&lt;/span&gt;." data-de="&lt;b&gt;Bei diesem Preis &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;diff&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.62&quot;&gt;0,62 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg mehr als in Kampala.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Für 10 Sack: &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;total&quot; data-eur=&quot;3546&quot;&gt;3.546 €&lt;/span&gt;."><b>At this price <span class="m" data-k="diff" data-eur="0.62">EUR 0.62</span> more per kg than in Kampala.</b><br>For 10 bags: <span class="m" data-k="total" data-eur="3546">EUR 3,546</span>.</p>
  <p class="gain" data-when="below" hidden data-en="At this price you receive less than in Kampala. Then way B does not pay off for this lot." data-de="Bei diesem Preis bekommt ihr weniger als in Kampala. Dann lohnt sich Weg B für dieses Lot nicht.">At this price you receive less than in Kampala. Then way B does not pay off for this lot.</p>
  <div class="ex-ctl" hidden>
    <input type="range" id="ex-price" min="6" max="14" step="0.25" value="9">
    <label for="ex-price" class="ex-lab"><span data-en="If a roaster agrees &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;price&quot; data-eur=&quot;9.0&quot;&gt;EUR 9.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;kg" data-de="Wenn ein Röster &lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;price&quot; data-eur=&quot;9.0&quot;&gt;9,00 €&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;kg zusagt">If a roaster agrees <b><span class="m" data-k="price" data-eur="9.0">EUR 9.00</span></b>&nbsp;/&nbsp;kg</span></label>
  </div>
  <p class="lead sm ex-zone low" data-zone="1" hidden data-en="Commercial quality, under 80 points." data-de="Handelsqualität, unter 80 Punkte.">Commercial quality, under 80 points.</p>
  <p class="lead sm ex-zone" data-zone="2" data-en="Specialty, 80 to 84 points, clean cup, plot coordinates complete." data-de="Specialty, 80 bis 84 Punkte, sauberer Cup, Koordinaten aller Flächen vollständig.">Specialty, 80 to 84 points, clean cup, plot coordinates complete.</p>
  <p class="lead sm ex-zone" data-zone="3" hidden data-en="84 to 86 points, or certified organic or Fairtrade, or a farm story roasters can tell." data-de="84 bis 86 Punkte, oder zertifiziert Bio oder Fairtrade, oder eine Farmgeschichte, die Röster erzählen können.">84 to 86 points, or certified organic or Fairtrade, or a farm story roasters can tell.</p>
  <p class="lead sm ex-zone" data-zone="4" hidden data-en="86 points and more, micro-lot. Few lots reach this." data-de="86 Punkte und mehr, Micro-Lot. Das erreichen nur wenige Lots.">86 points and more, micro-lot. Few lots reach this.</p>
  <p class="sec-note split-h" data-en="Where the Hamburg price goes" data-de="Wohin der Hamburger Preis geht">Where the Hamburg price goes</p>
  <svg class="gfx gfx-split" viewBox="0 0 360 36" role="img" aria-labelledby="sp-t"><title id="sp-t">Of EUR 9.00 per kg: you EUR 5.91, Zuricaf EUR 1.30, logistics and cess EUR 1.79</title>
<rect id="bar-you" x="10.0" y="4" width="223.3" height="28" rx="3" class="w-you"/>
<rect id="bar-us" x="233.3" y="4" width="49.1" height="28" rx="3" class="w-us"/>
<rect id="bar-cost" x="282.4" y="4" width="67.6" height="28" rx="3" class="w-cost"/>
</svg>
  <p class="legend"><span class="leg"><i class="w-you"></i><span data-en="You &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;you&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.91&quot;&gt;EUR 5.91&lt;/span&gt;" data-de="Ihr &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;you&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.91&quot;&gt;5,91 €&lt;/span&gt;">You <span class="m" data-k="you" data-eur="5.91">EUR 5.91</span></span></span><span class="leg"><i class="w-us"></i><span data-en="Zuricaf (marketing and sales) &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;us&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.30&quot;&gt;EUR 1.30&lt;/span&gt;" data-de="Zuricaf (Marketing und Vertrieb) &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;us&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.30&quot;&gt;1,30 €&lt;/span&gt;">Zuricaf (marketing and sales) <span class="m" data-k="us" data-eur="1.30">EUR 1.30</span></span></span><span class="leg"><i class="w-cost"></i><span data-en="Logistics and cess &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;cost&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.79&quot;&gt;EUR 1.79&lt;/span&gt;" data-de="Logistik und Cess &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;cost&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.79&quot;&gt;1,79 €&lt;/span&gt;">Logistics and cess <span class="m" data-k="cost" data-eur="1.79">EUR 1.79</span></span></span></p>
  <details class="ex-more"><summary data-en="How it is calculated" data-de="So wird gerechnet">How it is calculated</summary>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="Per kg, way B.&lt;br&gt;Roaster pays &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;price&quot; data-eur=&quot;9.0&quot;&gt;EUR 9.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Off the price:&lt;br&gt;Shipping rate &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.6&quot;&gt;EUR 1.60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Uganda cess, 2% of the registered value &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;cess&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.11&quot;&gt;EUR 0.11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Storage and insurance &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.08&quot;&gt;EUR 0.08&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our share, &lt;span class=&quot;m bare&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;EUR 0.40&lt;/span&gt; plus 10% &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;us&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.3&quot;&gt;EUR 1.30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;You receive &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;you&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.91&quot;&gt;EUR 5.91&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" data-de="Je kg, Weg B.&lt;br&gt;Röster zahlt &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;price&quot; data-eur=&quot;9.0&quot;&gt;9,00 €&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Davon ab:&lt;br&gt;Rate &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.6&quot;&gt;1,60 €&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Uganda-Cess, 2 % des eingetragenen Werts &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;cess&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.11&quot;&gt;0,11 €&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lager und Versicherung &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.08&quot;&gt;0,08 €&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unser Anteil, &lt;span class=&quot;m bare&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;0,40 €&lt;/span&gt; plus 10 % &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;us&quot; data-eur=&quot;1.3&quot;&gt;1,30 €&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ihr bekommt &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;you&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.91&quot;&gt;5,91 €&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;">Per kg, way B.<br>Roaster pays <span class="m" data-k="price" data-eur="9.0">EUR 9.00</span><br>Off the price:<br>Shipping rate <span class="m" data-eur="1.6">EUR 1.60</span><br>Uganda cess, 2% of the registered value <span class="m" data-k="cess" data-eur="0.11">EUR 0.11</span><br>Storage and insurance <span class="m" data-eur="0.08">EUR 0.08</span><br>Our share, <span class="m bare" data-eur="0.4">EUR 0.40</span> plus 10% <span class="m" data-k="us" data-eur="1.3">EUR 1.30</span><br><b>You receive <span class="m" data-k="you" data-eur="5.91">EUR 5.91</span></b></p>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="The price is agreed with the roaster before the container is sealed. You pay nothing up front and never pay anything in. If no roaster agrees a price in time, your coffee stays yours in Kampala, or ships in way A. Quality claims agreed with the roaster come off the price. If the roaster rightly rejects the coffee on arrival, we sell it to a green coffee trader in Hamburg and the same calculation applies." data-de="Der Preis wird mit dem Röster vereinbart, bevor der Container plombiert wird. Ihr zahlt nichts vorab und nie etwas drauf. Sagt kein Röster rechtzeitig einen Preis zu, bleibt euer Kaffee euer Kaffee in Kampala oder fährt über Weg A. Mit dem Röster vereinbarte Qualitätsabzüge gehen vom Preis ab. Lehnt der Röster den Kaffee bei Ankunft berechtigt ab, verkaufen wir ihn an einen Rohkaffeehändler in Hamburg, und es gilt dieselbe Rechnung.">The price is agreed with the roaster before the container is sealed. You pay nothing up front and never pay anything in. If no roaster agrees a price in time, your coffee stays yours in Kampala, or ships in way A. Quality claims agreed with the roaster come off the price. If the roaster rightly rejects the coffee on arrival, we sell it to a green coffee trader in Hamburg and the same calculation applies.</p>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="Way A with the same coffee: your buyer pays the shipping rate and sells. We receive 10%, here &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;wa&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.9&quot;&gt;EUR 0.90&lt;/span&gt; per kg, only if a roaster we introduced buys. In way B we also pay the shipping up front and do the selling, for &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;EUR 0.40&lt;/span&gt; per kg more." data-de="Weg A mit demselben Kaffee: Euer Käufer zahlt die Rate und verkauft. Wir bekommen 10 %, hier &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;wa&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.9&quot;&gt;0,90 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg, nur wenn ein von uns vorgestellter Röster kauft. In Weg B legen wir zusätzlich die Rate aus und verkaufen, für &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-eur=&quot;0.4&quot;&gt;0,40 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg mehr.">Way A with the same coffee: your buyer pays the shipping rate and sells. We receive 10%, here <span class="m" data-k="wa" data-eur="0.9">EUR 0.90</span> per kg, only if a roaster we introduced buys. In way B we also pay the shipping up front and do the selling, for <span class="m" data-eur="0.4">EUR 0.40</span> per kg more.</p>
  <p class="lead sm" data-en="Registered value: set from the official UCDA daily price at registration. On 10 Nov 2026 (UCDA/MAAIF Daily Coffee Market Report): &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;reg&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.29&quot;&gt;EUR 5.29&lt;/span&gt; per kg." data-de="Eingetragener Wert: bei der Registrierung aus dem offiziellen UCDA-Tagespreis gesetzt. Am 10.11.2026 (UCDA/MAAIF Daily Coffee Market Report): &lt;span class=&quot;m&quot; data-k=&quot;reg&quot; data-eur=&quot;5.29&quot;&gt;5,29 €&lt;/span&gt; je kg.">Registered value: set from the official UCDA daily price at registration. On 10 Nov 2026 (UCDA/MAAIF Daily Coffee Market Report): <span class="m" data-k="reg" data-eur="5.29">EUR 5.29</span> per kg.</p>
  <p class="fine" data-en="Example, not a quote. The price is agreed in EUR. The UGX amount depends on the exchange rate on the day we pay. We pay you within 10 working days after the roaster pays. The shipping rate falls as the container fills." data-de="Beispiel, kein Angebot. Der Preis wird in EUR vereinbart. Der Betrag in UGX hängt vom Kurs am Zahltag ab. Wir zahlen binnen 10 Werktagen, nachdem der Röster gezahlt hat. Die Rate sinkt, je voller der Container wird.">Example, not a quote. The price is agreed in EUR. The UGX amount depends on the exchange rate on the day we pay. We pay you within 10 working days after the roaster pays. The shipping rate falls as the container fills.</p>
  </details>
  <p class="fine" data-en="Example, not a quote. The price is only known after cupping and sale. The zones describe typical lots, not a grading of yours. Net of VAT where it applies. Amounts are set in EUR. UGX figures are rounded approximations at the mid-market rate of 9 Nov 2026 (EUR 1 = UGX 4,586); the rate changes." data-de="Beispiel, kein Angebot. Der Preis steht erst nach Cupping und Verkauf fest. Die Zonen beschreiben typische Lots, keine Bewertung eures Lots. Ohne Umsatzsteuer, soweit sie anfällt. Beträge gelten in EUR. UGX-Werte sind gerundete Näherungen zum Mittelkurs vom 9.11.2026 (1 € = 4.586 UGX); der Kurs ändert sich.">Example, not a quote. The price is only known after cupping and sale. The zones describe typical lots, not a grading of yours. Net of VAT where it applies. Amounts are set in EUR. UGX figures are rounded approximations at the mid-market rate of 9 Nov 2026 (EUR 1 = UGX 4,586); the rate changes.</p>
</section>

<section class="c">
  <p class="sec-note" data-en="Route and process" data-de="Route und Ablauf">Route and process</p>
  <svg class="gfx gfx-route" viewBox="0 0 360 130" role="img" aria-labelledby="rt-b"><title id="rt-b">Route Kampala, by road to Mombasa, by sea to Hamburg</title>
<line x1="76" y1="40" x2="164" y2="40" class="g-road"/>
<line x1="196" y1="40" x2="284" y2="40" class="g-sea"/>
<text x="120" y="26" class="g-conn" text-anchor="middle" data-en="By road" data-de="Per Lkw">By road</text>
<text x="240" y="26" class="g-conn" text-anchor="middle" data-en="By sea" data-de="Per Schiff">By sea</text>
